  "description": "Strict manifest contract for one deterministic four-member reproduction Capsule around the exact PULSEmech Device Ledger v0 synthetic reference .pulseledger, the unchanged standalone verifier, and the exact canonical positive verifier report. The manifest fixes source identities, archive layout, reproduction expectations, targeted package-signature mutation expectations, and non-authority boundaries without inventorying or hashing itself.",
  "$comment": "The manifest member declares only its fixed path, role, media type, and archive ordinal. Its own size and SHA-256 are intentionally excluded to avoid circularity. The exact manifest identity and final Capsule identity are recorded outside this manifest, including by the later reproduction result. Semantic regression must also enforce canonical stored JSON under pulsemech_device_canonical_json_v0 and exact equality between source bytes and Capsule payload bytes.",
